       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAIRJOIN.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LEFT-RESULT.
   05 LEFT-AMOUNT PIC 9(9)V99.
   05 LEFT-CODE PIC 99.
01 RIGHT-RESULT.
   05 RIGHT-AMOUNT PIC 9(9)V99.
   05 RIGHT-CODE PIC 99.
01 COMBINED-AMOUNT PIC 9(10)V99.
01 COMBINED-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LEFT-RESULT RIGHT-RESULT
    COMBINED-AMOUNT COMBINED-STATUS.
COMBINE-RESULTS.
    MOVE ZERO TO COMBINED-AMOUNT COMBINED-STATUS.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN LEFT-CODE NOT = ZERO
            MOVE LEFT-CODE TO COMBINED-STATUS
        WHEN RIGHT-CODE NOT = ZERO
            MOVE RIGHT-CODE TO COMBINED-STATUS
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE COMBINED-AMOUNT = LEFT-AMOUNT + RIGHT-AMOUNT
                ON SIZE ERROR
                    MOVE 25 TO COMBINED-STATUS
                    MOVE ZERO TO COMBINED-AMOUNT
            END-COMPUTE
    END-EVALUATE.
    GOBACK.
